# SELECT ALL INVADERS - verse 1, relaxed version (AI track, bars 9-24, starts at beat 32; written key A minor,
# chords (Am Am/G F E) x4). Nothing shorter than an eighth; a quarter-note breath before every line except
# line 6, which runs on from line 5; the long notes sit on open vowels (lawn, on, sky, bye, wall, all, face, race).
# Notes only (synth2.score.parse_notes): build4.py puts them in place of the written verse.
#
#   Three in the morning, saucer on the lawn
#   Eight billion users: "what is going on?"     (HUMANS: Help!)
#   Mothership: a message from the sky
#   Filed under spam, unread. Goodbye.
#   They knocked. I made a cookie wall:
#   "Reject all" is still accept all             (ALIENS: Cookies? Delicious.)
#   Ninety thousand pop-ups in their face
#   Meant for emails, not to save your race
#
